### IFR wiring gaps (all blocked until LJMB geometry + IFR missions land)

**IFR-1 — `ClearedTo` from `Uncleaned` fails**
No runway at filing time; `Uncleaned → EnRouteClearance` transition needs one.
Needs pre-clearance runway assignment or accepting runway from a prior instruction.

**IFR-2 — IFR arrival HTN has no `arrivalJoinTask()`**
Pilot starts at `FLY_STAR` with no initial contact or inbound call.

**IFR-3 — `createMission` never passes `ifr=true`**
IFR missions cannot be constructed through that path yet.

**IFR-4 — `applyFplAmendment` silently discards `AmendmentError`**
Uses `getOrNull()` — genuine errors (FixNotOnRoute, InvalidTransition) are lost.

**IFR-5 — STAR-to-approach gap**
If last STAR waypoint ≠ first approach waypoint, a direct segment must be inserted.

**IFR-6 — Altitude constraint resolution needs transition altitude awareness**
`resolveAltitudeConstraint` must convert between QNH and STD at the transition altitude.

